msgid "abilities/common/description/autoLoaderGun"
msgstr ""
"Allows a series of shells to be fired from the magazine one by one, with "
"each round reloading automatically over time."

msgid "abilities/common/description/autoLoaderGunBoost"
msgstr ""
"Allows a series of shells to be fired from the magazine one by one, with "
"each round reloading automatically over time. Provides a bonus to the speed "
"of loading of the next shell during reload."

msgid "abilities/common/description/autoShootGun"
msgstr ""
"Fires rapid bursts of shells to deliver high damage in a short time, at the "
"cost of penetration and accuracy. Most effective in close-quarters combat."

msgid "abilities/common/description/damageMutable"
msgstr ""
"Fires star shells, causing maximum damage within 50 m. The shells' damage "
"decreases over distance, making them most effective in close combat."

msgid "abilities/common/description/dualAccuracy"
msgstr ""
"A unique cooling system that allows for double aiming: waiting after "
"reloading allows the gun to fire more accurately. The improved accuracy is "
"shown by a second, smaller aiming circle."

msgid "abilities/common/description/dualGun"
msgstr ""
"A double gun system with the ability to fire both barrels separately or "
"simultaneously. Double shots cause high burst damage, but come with a longer"
" reload."

msgid "abilities/common/description/hydraulicChassis"
msgstr ""
"Allows the vehicle's hull to change elevation angles, offering opportunities"
" for fire from more positions in battle. Activation depends on various "
"conditions."

msgid "abilities/common/description/hydraulicWheeledChassis"
msgstr ""
"Changes the position of additional wheels to significantly increase speed, "
"but at the cost of maneuverability. Best used to traverse long distances and"
" for rush attacks."

msgid "abilities/common/description/magazineGun"
msgstr ""
"Allows a series of shells to be fired from the magazine before requiring a "
"full reload. Delivers high burst damage, but leaves the vehicle vulnerable "
"while reloading. Can only reload the entire magazine at once."

msgid "abilities/common/description/overheatGun"
msgstr ""
"The gun can fire continuously without the need for reload. Each shot "
"generates heat: the higher its temperature, the more some of its parameters "
"change. Continuous firing will cause the gun to overheat, preventing further"
" firing until it cools down."

msgid "abilities/common/description/rocketAcceleration"
msgstr ""
"Increase engine power and top speed for rapid movement across the "
"battlefield. When activated, jet boosters reduce maneuverability and cannot "
"be disabled manually."

msgid "abilities/common/description/shellParamsSwitcher"
msgstr ""
"The vehicle's gun has special devices that allow some shell parameters to be"
" modified before firing. Parameters for different shells vary based on the "
"selected mode, and each mode lets you quickly adapt to different combat "
"situations."

msgid "abilities/common/description/siegeMode"
msgstr ""
"When activated, this special mode increases and/or changes certain battle "
"parameters. Best activated when in position and ready to engage the enemy."

msgid "abilities/common/description/stun"
msgstr ""
"Stuns enemy vehicles within a certain blast radius, even without a direct "
"hit, briefly worsening their mobility, accuracy, and reload time. Stunned "
"enemies are marked with a stun indicator."

msgid "abilities/common/description/trackWithinTrack"
msgstr ""
"Allows the vehicle to move at reduced speed when the main track is "
"destroyed. Losing an additional outer track reduces mobility further, but "
"the vehicle can still turn and move."

msgid "abilities/common/description/turboshaftEngine"
msgstr ""
"Allows the vehicle to travel significantly faster while considerably "
"decreasing gun handling parameters."

msgid "abilities/common/description/twinGun"
msgstr ""
"When activated, this special mode offers double damage and increases and/or "
"changes certain battle parameters. Best used in close-range encounters."

msgid "abilities/common/name/autoLoaderGun"
msgstr "Autoreloader"

msgid "abilities/common/name/autoLoaderGunBoost"
msgstr "Improved Autoreloader"

msgid "abilities/common/name/autoShootGun"
msgstr "Autocannon"

msgid "abilities/common/name/damageMutable"
msgstr "Deep-Rifled Gun"

msgid "abilities/common/name/dualAccuracy"
msgstr "Gun Cooling"

msgid "abilities/common/name/dualGun"
msgstr "Double Gun"

msgid "abilities/common/name/hydraulicChassis"
msgstr "Hydropneumatic Suspension"

msgid "abilities/common/name/hydraulicWheeledChassis"
msgstr "Rapid Mode"

msgid "abilities/common/name/magazineGun"
msgstr "Autoloader"

msgid "abilities/common/name/overheatGun"
msgstr "Thermal Overheat Control Autocannon"

msgid "abilities/common/name/rocketAcceleration"
msgstr "Jet Boosters"

msgid "abilities/common/name/shellParamsSwitcher"
msgstr "Shell Calibration System"

msgid "abilities/common/name/siegeMode"
msgstr "Siege Mode"

msgid "abilities/common/name/stun"
msgstr "Stun"

msgid "abilities/common/name/trackWithinTrack"
msgstr "Reserve Track"

msgid "abilities/common/name/turboshaftEngine"
msgstr "Turbo Mode"

msgid "abilities/common/name/twinGun"
msgstr "Salvo Fire Mode"

msgid "abilities/special/description/accuracyStacks"
msgstr ""
"By remaining stationary or moving slowly, you build accuracy levels to improve your next shot's precision.\n"
"At the highest accuracy level, you gain decent gun handling, with reduced dispersion even during movement or turret/hull traverse."

msgid "abilities/special/description/autoreloaderSurge"
msgstr ""
"The mechanism instantly reduces shell reload to a short fixed time. Each use"
" consumes one charge per shell, and charges replenish over time—faster when "
"the clip is full. A set number of charges is available at the start of "
"battle."

msgid "abilities/special/description/auxiliaryRocketLauncher"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle is equipped with a rocket launcher mounted in the gun mantlet. "
"Activate the ability to switch to the secondary weapon aiming sight, and "
"then launch an unguided HE rocket with the fire button."

msgid "abilities/special/description/battleFury"
msgstr ""
"Every time you hit an enemy with a shell, you gain a reload efficiency level, temporarily boosting your gun's reload speed. Levels accumulate with each hit. \n"
"Destroying an enemy vehicle with a shell grants additional reload efficiency levels."

msgid "abilities/special/description/bustleFeed"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle's External Ammunition Supply Module allows it to fire powerful "
"high-charge unitary rounds that cause increased damage. While active, the "
"module also reduces mobility and fire rate."

msgid "abilities/special/description/chargeShot"
msgstr ""
"If your gun is loaded, you can start heating your next shot for increased damage—the higher the heat level, the greater the effect.\n"
"At maximum heat, you have several seconds to fire—if you do not, you will be temporarily unable to shoot."

msgid "abilities/special/description/chargeableBurst"
msgstr ""
"Landing two armor-penetrating hits on enemy vehicles triggers Burst mode, "
"loading a burst-fire cassette that lets you unleash two shells in quick "
"succession with your next shot for massive damage."

msgid "abilities/special/description/concentrationMode"
msgstr ""
"The Pneumatic Gyro-Stabilizer grants maximum stabilization during movement, "
"hull traverse, and turret traverse, allowing for more accurate firing, as "
"well as rapid response to sudden threats and effective engagement from "
"cover."

msgid "abilities/special/description/extraShotClip"
msgstr ""
"The system automatically begins loading a new cassette when one shell "
"remains in the current one, keeping you ready to engage. You can still fire "
"the final shell during this process, but doing so adds several seconds to "
"the remaining reload time."

msgid "abilities/special/description/heatingZonesGun"
msgstr ""
"The system keeps the gun cooled, allowing for highly accurate firing. The "
"gun heats up when fired, but begins cooling down and returns to improved "
"parameters during reload. The higher its temperature, the more some of its "
"parameters change."

msgid "abilities/special/description/improvedRamming"
msgstr ""
"Drawing on design experience from earlier models, this vehicle is specially "
"configured for deadly ramming attacks. Structural reinforcements allow it to"
" deal more damage when ramming enemy vehicles, giving an upper hand in "
"close-quarters encounters."

msgid "abilities/special/description/lowChargeShot"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle's gun can fire early: single-charge shots, fired during reload,"
" have reduced effectiveness, while regular full-charge shots fired after "
"reloading have optimal ballistic parameters."

msgid "abilities/special/description/overheatGun"
msgstr ""
"The gun can fire continuously without the need for reload. Each shot "
"generates heat: the higher its temperature, the more some of its parameters "
"change. Continuous firing will cause the gun to overheat, preventing further"
" firing until it cools down."

msgid "abilities/special/description/overheatStacks"
msgstr ""
"Remain stationary or move slowly to build preheat, increasing your next "
"shot’s damage and accuracy. At maximum preheat, penetrating an enemy with "
"fewer HP than your average damage causes an ammo rack explosion, destroying "
"the vehicle."

msgid "abilities/special/description/pillboxSiegeMode"
msgstr ""
"This mode turns your vehicle into a fortified gun platform, granting "
"superior accuracy and faster reload time. In exchange for this enhanced "
"firepower, vehicle mobility—forward/reverse speed and vertical/horizontal "
"traverse—is severely limited."

msgid "abilities/special/description/powerMode"
msgstr ""
"This mode provides a significant boost to engine power and top forward "
"speed. The longer you drive forward, the more speed builds, allowing you to "
"surge across the battlefield and cover large distances with ease."

msgid "abilities/special/description/propellantAfterburnerGun"
msgstr ""
"The system accumulates a charge over time, with a higher charge granting "
"more bonus damage. The charge is capped by a limiter, which can be disabled "
"for an even greater damage bonus at the cost of reduced gun handling."

msgid "abilities/special/description/rechargeableNitro"
msgstr ""
"Activate the Liquid Fuel Boosters at any time for a burst of speed when you "
"need it most. The boosters heat up and must cool down before they can be "
"reused, while exceeding the critical heat level will temporarily disable "
"them completely."

msgid "abilities/special/description/shellCalibration"
msgstr ""
"When you hit a visible enemy vehicle with a shell, the fuze setter on the "
"next shell is adjusted. If the initial shot penetrated enemy armor, the next"
" shot's damage is increased. If it did not, the next shot's penetration is "
"increased."

msgid "abilities/special/description/shellParamsSwitcher"
msgstr ""
"The vehicle's gun has special devices that allow some shell parameters to be"
" modified before firing. Parameters for different shells vary based on the "
"selected mode, and each mode lets you quickly adapt to different combat "
"situations."

msgid "abilities/special/description/sightPointer"
msgstr ""
"When activated, the device scans a sector in front of your vehicle, "
"revealing concealed targets before a cooldown. If it reveals an unspotted "
"enemy, you also immediately become spotted. You can manually stop the scan "
"after a short delay."

msgid "abilities/special/description/stagedJetBoosters"
msgstr ""
"Solid-fuel thrusters that boost acceleration, mobility, and maneuverability "
"for several seconds. The left and right thrusters can work independently of "
"each other for faster hull traverse, and do not restrict reverse capability."

msgid "abilities/special/description/stanceDance"
msgstr ""
"Depending on the active mode and charge level, the vehicle can activate one of two abilities: \n"
"Ion-Discharge Afterburner: Increases engine power and speed. \n"
"Coincidence Electromechanical Sight: Reduces dispersion and reload time and improves accuracy."

msgid "abilities/special/description/stationaryReload"
msgstr ""
"This module keeps you in the fight by letting you interrupt reload at any "
"time if at least one shell is loaded. Press the hotkey to stop reloading, "
"fire after a short delay, then resume reload manually or let the clip auto-"
"reload when empty."

msgid "abilities/special/description/supportWeapon"
msgstr ""
"Pressing the activation button fires your vehicle's auxiliary weapons at the"
" target. This additional firepower comes with its own reload cycle, "
"independent of the main gun."

msgid "abilities/special/description/targetDesignator"
msgstr ""
"Your next shot applies an effect based on the enemy's spotting status. "
"Hitting a spotted enemy will mark them—they will remain spotted longer and "
"receive more damage. Hitting an unspotted enemy will highlight their "
"location with a special marker."

msgid "abilities/special/description/twinGun"
msgstr ""
"Offers double damage and improved stabilization at the cost of mobility, "
"accuracy, turret traverse speed, and aiming time. Best used in close combat."

msgid "abilities/special/description/wheeledDash"
msgstr ""
"This mechanical modification significantly boosts the vehicle's "
"acceleration, engine power, and top forward and reverse speed for a short "
"time, allowing you to react quickly to enemy attacks and catch opponents off"
" guard with dynamic maneuvers."

