msgstr "High-Pressure Turbocharger Assist"

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/accuracyStacks"
msgstr ""
"Increases the accuracy of your next shot, with decent stabilization at full "
"calibration."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/autoreloaderSurge"
msgstr "Instantly reduces shell reload to a short fixed time."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/auxiliaryRocketLauncher"
msgstr ""
"Fire an unguided HE-rocket from a coaxial launcher independently from the "
"main gun."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/battleFury"
msgstr ""
"Every hit to an enemy vehicle boosts gun reload speed for a limited time."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/bustleFeed"
msgstr "Fire high-damage rounds at the cost of mobility and cooldown."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/chargeShot"
msgstr ""
"Build up heat levels to cause more damage to enemy vehicles with your next "
"shot."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/chargeableBurst"
msgstr ""
"A burst-fire cassette that lets you fire two shells in quick succession."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/concentrationMode"
msgstr ""
"Maximizes stabilization during movement and traverse for more accurate "
"firing."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/extraShotClip"
msgstr ""
"Automatically starts reloading on the last shell, which can still be fired "
"during reload."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/heatingZonesGun"
msgstr "An active gun cooling system that improves accuracy as the gun cools."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/improvedRamming"
msgstr "Increases ramming damage caused to enemy vehicles."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/lowChargeShot"
msgstr ""
"A special gun mechanic that allows for earlier firing at the cost of shot "
"effectiveness."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/overheatGun"
msgstr ""
"The system allows for continuous fire without reload and controls how the "
"gun generates heat when firing."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/overheatStacks"
msgstr ""
"Standing still or moving slowly increases the damage and accuracy of the "
"next shot."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/pillboxSiegeMode"
msgstr ""
"Drastically increases gun accuracy and reload speed, but severely limits "
"mobility."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/powerMode"
msgstr ""
"Provides a boost to engine power, building top speed the longer the vehicle "
"keeps moving."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/propellantAfterburnerGun"
msgstr ""
"The system charges to boost damage. The higher the charge, the greater the "
"damage."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/rechargeableNitro"
msgstr ""
"Boosters that can be activated at any time to provide a sharp burst of "
"speed."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/shellCalibration"
msgstr ""
"Hitting a visible enemy vehicle increases the next shell's damage or "
"penetration."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/shellParamsSwitcher"
msgstr ""
"The gun has special devices that allow some shell parameters to be modified "
"before firing."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/sightPointer"
msgstr ""
"Extends view range and detects moving and foliage-hidden vehicles in a "
"narrow sector."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/stagedJetBoosters"
msgstr ""
"Solid-fuel thrusters that boost acceleration, mobility, and maneuverability."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/stanceDance"
msgstr ""
"Charges one of two unique abilities, increasing speed or improving gun "
"accuracy."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/stationaryReload"
msgstr "Allows you to interrupt reload and fire back in crucial moments."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/supportWeapon"
msgstr ""
"Some additional weapons to provide increased firepower alongside the main "
"gun."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/targetDesignator"
msgstr ""
"Increases enemies' time spotted and damage taken or highlights them with a "
"special marker."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/twinGun"
msgstr ""
"Allows firing from both guns simultaneously at the cost of increased reload "
"time."

msgid "abilities/special/shortDescription/wheeledDash"
msgstr ""
"A special mechanic that boosts engine power, acceleration, and top speed for"
" a short time."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/accuracyStacks"
msgstr ""
"Remaining stationary or moving below a certain speed allows your vehicle to "
"calibrate its Analog Ballistic Computing Device and build accuracy levels, "
"increasing the accuracy of your next shot. If you exceed the speed limit, "
"your progress in building accuracy levels will be paused until you slow "
"down. At the highest accuracy level, your vehicle gains decent gun "
"stabilization, with reduced dispersion from movement or turret/hull "
"rotation. The effect is removed upon firing."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/auxiliaryRocketLauncher"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle is equipped with a rocket launcher mounted in the gun mantlet. "
"Activate the ability to switch to the secondary weapon aiming sight, and "
"then launch an unguided HE rocket with the fire button."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/battleFury"
msgstr ""
"Every time you hit a visible enemy with a shell, you gain a reload "
"efficiency level, temporarily boosting your gun's reload speed. Levels "
"accumulate with each hit, and destroying an enemy vehicle with a shell "
"grants additional reload efficiency levels."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/bustleFeed"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle's External Ammunition Supply Module allows it to fire powerful "
"high-charge unitary rounds that cause increased damage. While active, the "
"module also reduces mobility and fire rate."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/chargeShot"
msgstr ""
"If your gun is loaded, you can start to heat your next shot. The higher the "
"heat level you reach, the greater the bonus to average damage will be. "
"During the heating process, you cannot change shells. When you reach maximum"
" heat level, a countdown begins. If you do not fire before it ends, you will"
" be unable to shoot for several seconds."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/chargeableBurst"
msgstr ""
"Scoring two armor-penetrating hits on enemy vehicles activates Burst mode, "
"loading a burst-fire cassette that allows two shells to be fired in quick "
"succession with the next shot."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/concentrationMode"
msgstr ""
"The Pneumatic Gyro-Stabilizer grants maximum stabilization during hull and "
"turret traverse for a short time, allowing for more accurate firing on the "
"move and quick reaction to sudden threats."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/extraShotClip"
msgstr ""
"The system automatically starts loading a new cassette when one shell "
"remains in the current one. Firing the final shell while the new cassette is"
" being loaded adds several seconds to the remaining reload time. Pressing "
"the Reload Shell Container hotkey discards all remaining shells except the "
"last one. Press the hotkey twice to reset a fully loaded cassette."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/heatingZonesGun"
msgstr ""
"The system keeps the gun cooled, allowing for highly accurate firing. The "
"gun heats up when fired, but begins cooling down and returns to improved "
"parameters during reload. The higher its temperature, the more some of its "
"parameters change."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/improvedRamming"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle is specially configured for ramming attacks, with a series of "
"design modifications that help it inflict more damage when ramming enemy "
"vehicles."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/lowChargeShot"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle's gun can fire early: single-charge shots, fired during reload,"
" have reduced effectiveness, while regular full-charge shots fired after "
"reloading have optimal ballistic parameters."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/overheatGun"
msgstr ""
"The gun can fire continuously without the need for reload. Each shot "
"generates heat: the higher its temperature, the more some of its parameters "
"change. Continuous firing will cause the gun to overheat, preventing further"
" firing until it cools down."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/overheatStacks"
msgstr ""
"Remaining stationary or moving below a certain speed generates preheat, "
"which increases the average damage and accuracy of your next shot. Exceeding"
" the speed limit gradually reduces the bonus, while firing or changing "
"shells instantly resets it. At maximum preheat level, penetrating the armor "
"of an enemy vehicle with fewer hit points than your average damage—including"
" your accumulated preheat bonus—will cause its ammo rack to explode, "
"instantly destroying the vehicle."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/pillboxSiegeMode"
msgstr ""
"In this mode, gun accuracy, reload speed, and elevation/depression angles "
"are drastically increased, but mobility (forward/reverse speed and "
"vertical/horizontal traverse speed) is severely limited. Percentage values "
"are given for comparison with Siege mode."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/powerMode"
msgstr ""
"Direct Drive mode provides a significant boost to engine power and top "
"forward speed. The longer you drive forward, the more speed builds, allowing"
" you to traverse the battlefield with ease."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/propellantAfterburnerGun"
msgstr ""
"Over time, the system automatically accumulates a charge, which is partially"
" consumed to boost damage when firing. The higher the charge, the greater "
"the bonus damage. By default, the system only stores the charge up to a "
"certain limit. Disabling the limit lets it accumulate an even higher charge,"
" granting a much greater damage bonus but reducing gun handling."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/rechargeableNitro"
msgstr ""
"The Liquid Fuel Boosters grant a burst of engine power, allowing you to gain"
" a positional advantage on the battlefield—but limiting your vehicle's "
"reverse and traverse speed. They can be toggled on or off at any time, "
"except after reaching the reactivation limit. The boosters heat up while "
"active and become unavailable until cooled down, meaning they cannot be used"
" nonstop—while exceeding the critical heat level will temporarily disable "
"them completely. Plan your moves carefully to avoid being caught off guard."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/shellCalibration"
msgstr ""
"Upon hitting a visible enemy vehicle with a shell, the fuze setter on the "
"next shell is adjusted. If the initial shot penetrated enemy armor, the next"
" shot's damage is increased. If it did not, the next shot's penetration is "
"increased."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/shellParamsSwitcher"
msgstr ""
"The vehicle's gun has special devices that allow some shell parameters to be"
" modified before firing. The loadout shows which parameters will be affected"
" by switching between firing modes."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/sightPointer"
msgstr ""
"An advanced optics device increases your view range and enhances detection "
"of moving and foliage-hidden vehicles. When activated, it scans a narrow "
"sector in front of your vehicle, revealing concealed targets before a "
"cooldown period. If it reveals an unspotted enemy, you also immediately "
"become spotted. You can manually stop the scan after a short delay."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/stagedJetBoosters"
msgstr ""
"Solid-fuel thrusters that improve vehicle acceleration, mobility, and "
"maneuverability for several seconds. Unlike regular jet boosters, the left "
"and right thrusters can work independently of each other for faster hull "
"traverse, and do not restrict reverse capability. They can be used multiple "
"times per battle, but require a cooldown before reactivation."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/stanceDance"
msgstr ""
"Depending on the active mode and charge level, the vehicle can activate one of two abilities: Ion-Discharge Afterburner or Coincidence Electromechanical Sight.\n"
"Ion-Discharge Afterburner temporarily increases engine power, top forward speed, and reverse speed. Coincidence Electromechanical Sight temporarily improves accuracy and reduces reload time."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/stationaryReload"
msgstr ""
"The External Ammunition Supply Module allows you to interrupt reload and "
"start firing at any time, as long as you still have one shell loaded. During"
" reload, the module locks the vehicle's turret and external ammo pods, "
"temporarily preventing you from aiming or firing unless you interrupt it."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/supportWeapon"
msgstr ""
"This vehicle is equipped with a set of auxiliary weapons whose reload cycle "
"is separate from the main gun, allowing you to cause additional damage in "
"key moments."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/targetDesignator"
msgstr ""
"The Laser Target Designator adds a special effect to your next shot, applied"
" to any enemy you hit. The effect varies depending on whether the enemy was "
"spotted at the moment of impact. Hitting a spotted enemy vehicle will mark "
"it, extending the time it remains spotted and increasing the damage it "
"receives from shells, while hitting an unspotted enemy vehicle will "
"highlight its location with a special marker."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/twinGun"
msgstr ""
"Offers double damage and improved stabilization at the cost of mobility, "
"accuracy, turret traverse speed, and aiming time. Best used in close combat."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/description/wheeledDash"
msgstr ""
"This mechanical modification significantly boosts the vehicle's "
"acceleration, engine power, and top forward and reverse speed for a short "
"time, allowing you to react quickly to enemy attacks and catch opponents off"
" guard with dynamic maneuvers. Maintaining a high movement speed accelerates"
" the mechanic's cooldown."

msgid "characteristics/abilities/special/notes"
msgstr ""
"All values shown are the maximum possible for the vehicle. Equipment, "
